        <!-- ============ Security sidebar ============ -->
        <mxCell id="seclayers" value="Fabric Workspace Security (defense in depth)&#10;&#10;1. Network — firewall FQDN allow-list (this request);&#10;    optional: Private Link / Entra Conditional Access&#10;&#10;2. Authentication — Entra ID only (no local SQL auth);&#10;    MFA + Conditional Access policies&#10;&#10;3. Workspace roles — Admin / Member /&#10;    Contributor / Viewer (assign via Entra groups)&#10;&#10;4. Item permissions — share individual Lakehouse /&#10;    Warehouse / KQL DB; ReadData / ReadAll /&#10;    Build granular flags&#10;&#10;5. Data-level — SQL GRANT/DENY, row-level &amp;amp;&#10;    column-level security (Warehouse / SQL endpoint);&#10;    KQL RLS policies; OneLake data access roles (folder&#10;    level)&#10;&#10;6. Governance — sensitivity labels (Purview),&#10;    DLP policies, tenant/capacity admin settings,&#10;    audit logs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#F0F6FF;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
